request.description:
Called by a ConnectJob recruiter clicking Disconnect on the Integration tab.
JWT required. Notifies WingDigital ERP best-effort, then marks partner disconnected.
Returns: { status: 'success', message: 'Integration disconnected.' }

Returns ConnectJob job categories (id, name, code) from JobCategoryModel.
Used by the Data Mapping UI to populate the **Source Value** dropdown for the 'category' field.

Response:
{
  "data": [
    { "id": 1, "name": "Business & Management", "code": "" },
    { "id": 2, "name": "Information Technology (IT)", "code": "" },
    ...
  ]
}

Re-applies the 19 pre-defined default field mappings.
Only adds MISSING defaults — never overwrites existing customised mappings.
Returns: { added: [...], message: '...' }

Maps multiple ERP values to one ConnectJob category in one request.
Existing ERP values are skipped (idempotent).
Returns: { created: [...], skipped: [...] }
